  "notes": "v0.34 foot_stems (docs/foot_stems.md): source 'wood_floor', rebuilt from stems of a CC0 recording (THIRD_PARTY.md). Legacy recipe name, now served by foot_stems (a soft real step by default). Older macros (hardness, muffle, hollowness, contact_point) still parse; hardness and muffle map lightly onto force and softness. The seed macro (or any variation) remixes the real stems; nothing is averaged, bands are not pitch-shifted (size is tape speed), and there is no freeze, time-squeeze or added smoothing. The dedicated surface and shoe recipes (wood_floor, trainers_walk, \u2026) are the ones to use for new work.",
  "hidden": true,
  "replaced_by": "footstep"
